   "design": "The request form asks the referrer for the clinical question and the items each study needs, such as thyroid medication, glucose and pregnancy status, so fewer calls go back. A view in the record lists those items and prior studies instead of the technologist searching notes. Patients answer a questionnaire before the visit. The technologist confirms the answers in person on a tablet checklist that writes to the radiology information system, instead of a paper checklist typed in later. Asking the patient and consulting the physician stay with the technologist.",
   "approvals": [],
   "previous_blocker": "History was searched in notes and checklists were typed in later.",
   "enabler_now": "Structured requests, record views and tablet checklists.",
   "still_hard": "Patients who cannot answer for themselves.",
   "human_edge": "Hearing a detail that changes which scan the patient needs.",
